#   3. delete related scheduled tasks (incl. .job files, C:\Windows\Tasks)
#   4. delete related firewall rules
#   5. delete uninstall / App Paths / Run / RunOnce registry entries
#   6. deep registry sweep: HKLM\Software (64+32), HKCU\Software, HKCR
#      (COM / TypeLib / ProgID / CLSID registrations, values whose name or
#      data points at the app)
